# Only the front end and the Caddyfile reach this build; the repository's
# .dockerignore excludes web/ for the Go image, and BuildKit prefers this
# file, named after the Dockerfile, for builds that name it with -f.
*
!web/trade
web/trade/node_modules
web/trade/dist
web/trade/test-results
web/trade/playwright-report
!build/edge
